//! Port of the C# journal compaction plan tests (C# baseline d92d6aae, `tests/PhotoReview.Core.Tests/FileActions/`):
//! `JournalCompactionPlanTests`, `JournalCompactionPlanReprepareTests`, the plan facts of
//! `JournalGroupEvidenceAndNulMemberTests` and `JournalSmallGapsTests`, plus the golden check against
//! `tests/golden/journal-compaction-plan.json` (70 cases generated by `tools/oracle-cs`).
//!
//! Port of `PhotoReview.Core/FileActions/JournalCompactionPlan.cs` (`pr_core::file_actions::compaction`). The
//! observational-equivalence tests also drive `OperationJournal` (W3-01 bodies); they stay red until those land, so the
//! smoke one is `#[ignore]`d too until the D24 follow-up PR after W3-01 (the slow ones already are).
//! Every test here is red against the `todo!()` stubs. Contract: `contracts/W3-02.md`.

